#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:2
msgid "Azure Scale Sets"
msgstr "Azure Scale Sets"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:4
msgid ""
"Auto-scaling Azure instances can be done with the native Morpheus scaling"
" service or Azure Scale Sets. When using Azure Scale Sets, Morpheus will "
"configure the scale sets and thresholds, but Azure will be responsible "
"for scaling the instances. The Instances nodes that are added and removed"
" by Azure will be synced in by Morpheus as the instance scales up and "
"down."
msgstr "O auto-scaling de instâncias Azure pode ser feito com o serviço nativo de scaling do Morpheus ou com Azure Scale Sets. Ao usar Azure Scale Sets, as configurações de threshold e min/max nodes são gerenciadas no Azure."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:6
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:29
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:51
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:6
msgid "Instances can only be added to Azure Scale Sets at provision time."
msgstr "Instâncias só podem ser adicionadas a Azure Scale Sets no momento do provisionamento."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:9
msgid "Adding an Instance to a Scale Set"
msgstr "Adicionando uma Instância a um Scale Set"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:11
msgid "In ``Provisioning - Instances`` select :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Em ``Provisioning - Instances`` selecione :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select an Instance Type that has scaling enabled (Advanced section when "
"editing an Instance Type in `Provisioning - Library`)"
msgstr "Selecione um Instance Type que tenha scaling ativado (seção Advanced ao editar um Instance Type em `Provisioning - Library`)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:13
msgid "Configure the Instance as desired"
msgstr "Configure a Instância conforme desejado"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:14
msgid ""
"In the `AUTOMATION` section under `Scale - Scale Type` select `Azure "
"Scale Set`"
msgstr "Na seção `AUTOMATION` em `Scale - Scale Type` selecione `Azure Scale Set`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:15
msgid ""
"Select a default Threshold. Threshold pre-sets can be added in "
"`Provisioning - Automation- Scale Thresholds` (requires Instances - "
"Thresholds permission)"
msgstr "Selecione um Threshold padrão. Pré-definições de Threshold podem ser adicionadas em `Provisioning - Automation- Scale Thresholds` (exige permissões de Função Instances - Thresholds)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:17
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/azure/azure_scale_sets1.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:19
msgid "Complete the instance configuration and provision the instance."
msgstr "Conclua a configuração da instância e provisione a instância."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:21
msgid ""
"A Virtual Machine scale set will be created in Azure with the selected "
"threshold and min/max node settings."
msgstr "Um Virtual Machine scale set será criado no Azure com o threshold selecionado e as configurações de min/max nodes."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:24
msgid "Create Threshold Presets"
msgstr "Criar Pré-definições de Threshold"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:27
msgid "In ``Provisioning - Automation`` select the `SCALE THRESHOLDS` tab"
msgstr "Em ``Provisioning - Automation`` selecione a aba `SCALE THRESHOLDS`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:29
msgid ""
"Access to the SCALE THRESHOLDS section requires `Instances - Thresholds` "
"Role permissions."
msgstr "O acesso à seção SCALE THRESHOLDS exige permissões de Função `Instances - Thresholds`."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:31
msgid ".. image:: /images/provisioning/scalethresholds.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:32
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:33
msgid "Configure Threshold settings."
msgstr "Configure as configurações de Threshold."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:35
msgid ".. image:: /images/provisioning/scalethresholds1.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:37
msgid "Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:39
msgid ""
"The new Threshold will be available for selection in the SCALE section "
"during provisioning or when configuring an App Blueprint."
msgstr "O novo Threshold estará disponível para seleção na seção SCALE durante o provisionamento ou ao configurar um App Blueprint."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:43
msgid "Edit Thresholds on an Instance"
msgstr "Editar Thresholds em uma Instância"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:45
msgid "In ``Provisioning - Instances`` select the target Instance."
msgstr "Em ``Provisioning - Instances`` selecione a Instância de destino."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:46
msgid "Select the `SCALE` tab below the VM's section"
msgstr "Selecione a aba `SCALE` abaixo da seção das VMs"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:47
msgid "In the `THRESHOLDS` section of the SCALE tab, click :guilabel:`EDIT`"
msgstr "Na seção `THRESHOLDS` da aba SCALE, clique em :guilabel:`EDIT`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:48
msgid "Update the threshold settings."
msgstr "Atualize as configurações de threshold."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:49
msgid "Select :guilabel:`APPLY`"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`APPLY`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/scalesets.rst:51
msgid ""
"Morpheus will sync in changes to a scale sets threshold settings if the "
"settings are edited in Azure."
msgstr "O Morpheus sincronizará alterações nas configurações de threshold de um scale set se as configurações forem editadas no Azure."

